# ── Hand-edit backups: never commit these ────────────────────────────────────
# 193 of them had been committed and were removed 2026-07-28. The patterns below
# cover every variant found in the wild, including .bak2, which an earlier cleanup
# pass missed because it does not match *.bak-*.
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.bak.*
*.bak[0-9]*
*.prebak
*.prelegalfix*
*.orig

# ── Working scratch, not deliverables ────────────────────────────────────────
frontend/assets/cass-candidates/
.playwright-mcp/
.ship-loop/
.development-loop/
